<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Lojas Arapua 1996 net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Lojas Arapua 1996 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian retail chain Lojas Arapua issued the following statement on its 1996 consolidated results.</p>
<p>			     1996	     1995</p>
<p>    net profit	   118.990 million	33.991 million</p>
<p>net operating</p>
<p>    revenue		 1.759 bln	  1.158 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All data in Brazilian reais. Figures were calculated using inflation-adjusted accounting method.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
